{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"Leaving the palace is simple enough with the map, but it seems that the city has awakened. Undead-like Triton shuffle slowly in the water throughout the streets. They seem stirred by something yet are not overtly hostile enough to attack. They seem to begin shuffling towards you from crumbled ruins and alleyways as if to block your escape. They recoil away when lights from your suits aim at them, however you're not sure how long it will be before they try to brave the lights so you leave quickly.","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:25:04.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737571311496331325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
